# KB viva del profilo: caricamento completo. Le precedenti misure con KB
# ridotta sono obsolete; le attese legacy richiedono rivalidazione semantica.
# migrated from tests/cases/hypothesis.chat (gen346, hermetic + isolated)
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test hypothesis]
# gen84: hypothesis mode — "suppose X, then Y" creates a scoped fact
# and queries against it.
> suppose rex is a dog, then is rex a dog?
< Yes, under that supposition.
> suppose rex is a cat, then is rex a dog?
< No, even with that supposition.
# Supposition doesn't persist — rex is NOT known as a dog now.
> is rex a dog?
< I don't know about dog.

